# ---- NEVER COMMIT: real-conversation calibration data ----
# The classifier needs a held-out set of REAL utterances to be measured honestly. The corpus that
# would supply it is 9,997 inbound family messages, and 30%% of them are from one person who has not
# been asked and whose DMs are private. A held-out set built from real traffic and a held-out set
# that ships in this repo are MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE artifacts; the shipped one must be synthetic.
# This entry exists BEFORE any such file does, so the guard cannot arrive after the leak.
heldout*.json
held_out*.json
*_heldout*.jsonl
calibration_real*.json
_local_fixtures/
